{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Simon van Leeuwen, Notarius publicus, dat is: de practycke ende oeffeninge der notarissen (1665)"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:195924"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Vrijwilligersnetwerk Nederlandse Taal (SVNT)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"N. van der Sijs"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Vrijwilligersnetwerk Nederlandse Taal"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Diplomatische weergave (waarbij enkele evidente drukfouten zijn gecorrigeerd) van Notarius publicus, dat is: de practycke ende oeffeninge der notarissen. Door Mr. Simon van Leeuwen, Adt. Den vierden Druck van nieuws oversien, verbetert, ende vermeerdert [deel 2: Woorden-boeck]. Tot Dordrecht, By Jacob Rijffersz. Boeck-verkooper by de Visch-marckt, in ’t Vergulde A\/B\/C., 1665<\/p><p>Simon van Leeuwen (Leiden 1625 – ’s-Gravenhage 1682) heeft vele juridische publicaties op zijn naam staan. In 1656 verscheen van zijn hand Notarius publicus, dat is, de practycke ende oeffeninge der notarissen, gedrukt in Leiden. Achter de derde druk van Notarius publicus uit 1658 te Dordrecht voegde Van Leeuwen een puristische woordenlijst toe, bestaande uit ongeveer 4000 leenwoorden met voorgestelde vernederlandsingen, waarmee de woordenlijst omvangrijker was dan het hele notarisboek. Het woordenboek werd later ook apart gepubliceerd.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"puristische woordenlijst"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2020-12-28"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorType":{"typeName":"contributorType","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Project Leader"},"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"N. van der Sijs (Radboud Universiteit, Nijmegen)"}},{"contributorType":{"typeName":"contributorType","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Project Leader"},"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"H. Beelen (Carl von Ossietzky Universität Oldenburg (D))"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2020-12-30"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2020-12-29"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Gebruikt exemplaar:\nScans op googlebooks: https:\/\/books.google.nl\/books?id=Zz9lAAAAcAAJ&pg=PP11&source=gbs_selected_pages&cad=3#v=onepage&q&f=false"]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primi